      "source_text_excerpt": "Whenever outside servicing personnel are to be engaged in activities covered by the scope and application of this standard, the on-site employer and the outside employer shall inform each other of their respective lockout or tagout procedures.",
      "source_version": "2024-07-01",
      "source_retrieved_at": "2026-06-13T00:00:00Z",
